    "description": {
      "content": "The Google Sheets API lets you read, write, and format data in Google Sheets. It supports creating spreadsheets, reading and writing cell values, updating formatting, managing sheets within a spreadsheet, and working with developer metadata.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Workspace Developer Support",
